          "name": "Amazon MediaStore List Containers",
          "request": {
            "name": "Amazon MediaStore List Containers",
            "description": {
              "content": "<p>Lists the properties of all containers in AWS Elemental MediaStore. </p> <p>You can query to receive all the containers in one response. Or you can include the <code>MaxResults</code> parameter to receive a limited number of containers in each response. In this case, the response includes a token. To get the next set of containers, send the command again, this time with the <code>NextToken</code> parameter (with the returned token as its value). The next set of responses appears, with a token if there are still more containers to receive. </p> <p>See also <a>DescribeContainer</a>, which gets the properties of one container. </p>",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
